 . Pu`al Perfect 3 masculine singular רֻחָ֑ץ Prov 30:12 be washed (+ מִן of filth, figurative); 2 feminine singular בְּמַיִם לֹא רֻחַצְתְּ Ezek 16:4 (in figurative). Hithpa`el Perfect 1 singular הִתְרָחַצְתִּי במו שׁלג Job 9:30 if I washed myself in snow (figurative).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7880')\">BDB7880</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7364')\">H7364</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7879')\">BDB7879</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7881')\">BDB7881</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>רָחַץ</bdbheb><sub>72</sub> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>wash, wash off, away, bathe</highlightword> (Late Hebrew = Biblical Hebrew; Arabic <placeholder5038/> (also of garments); Ethiopic <placeholder5039/>, <placeholder5040/> <highlight>sweat</highlight>; compare Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>ra—âƒu</highlight></transliteration>, <highlight>overflow</highlight>, <highlight>flood</highlight> (on <transliteration><highlight>—</highlight></transliteration> = <placeholder5041/> see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Nö')\">Nö<sup>ZMG xi (1886), 727</sup></lookup>)); — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b><sub>69</sub> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 4:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,4,4)\">Isa 4:4</ref> +, etc.; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>יִרְחַץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 23:12\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(5,23,12)\">Deut 23:12</ref> + etc.; <highlight>Imperative</highlight> masculine singular <bdbheb>רְחַץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 11:8\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(10,11,8)\">2Sam 11:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 5:13\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(12,5,13)\">2Kgs 5:13</ref> masculine plural <bdbheb>רַחֲצוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 18:4\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(1,18,4)\">Gen 18:4</ref> +; <highlight>Infinitive construct</highlight> <bdbheb>רְחֹץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 24:32\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(1,24,32)\">Gen 24:32</ref> +, <bdbheb>לְרָחְצָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 30:18\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(2,30,18)\">Exod 30:18</ref> +; <highlight>Participle</highlight> feminine singular <bdbheb>רֹחֶ֫צֶת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 11:2\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(10,11,2)\">2Sam 11:2</ref>, feminine plural <bdbheb>רֹחֲצוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Song 5:12\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(22,5,12)\">Song 5:12</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> transitive <highlight>wash</highlight> (with water), with accusative feet (<bdbheb>רגלים</bdbheb>; <bdbheb>בַּמַּיִם</bdbheb> often expressed), <ref ref=\"Gen 18:4\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(1,18,4)\">Gen 18:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 19:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,2)\">Gen 19:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 24:32\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(1,24,32)\">Gen 24:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 43:24\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(1,43,24)\">Gen 43:24</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Judg 19:21\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(7,19,21)\">Judg 19:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 25:41\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(9,25,41)\">1Sam 25:41</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 11:8\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(10,11,8)\">2Sam 11:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Song 5:3\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd